:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Karan Manral</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135168441,imgsize-95708.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘No hesitation in detaining youth’: Congress targets government over US national VanDyke’s release in Myanmar arms case]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/no-hesitation-in-detaining-youth-congress-targets-government-over-us-national-vandykes-release-in-myanmar-arms-case/articleshow/135166874.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135166874.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Congress has raised concerns over the release of US national Matthew VanDyke, who is accused of terrorism. VanDyke was permitted to return home while protests against electoral irregularities continue. The National Investigation Agency is still investigating the Myanmar arms training case involving VanDyke and six Ukrainian nationals. The Congress leader criticized the government's approach to detaining Indian youth activists.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/no-hesitation-in-detaining-youth-congress-targets-government-over-us-national-vandykes-release-in-myanmar-arms-case/articleshow/135166874.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/no-hesitation-in-detaining-youth-congress-targets-government-over-us-national-vandykes-release-in-myanmar-arms-case/articleshow/135166874.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-24T15:43:28+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135167814,imgsize-1596852.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Why do some women become the strongest defenders of patriarchy]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/why-do-some-women-become-the-strongest-defenders-of-patriarchy/articleshow/135165441.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135165441.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/why-do-some-women-become-the-strongest-defenders-of-patriarchy/articleshow/135165441.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/why-do-some-women-become-the-strongest-defenders-of-patriarchy/articleshow/135165441.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-24T15:43:21+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Natasha Singh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135167446,imgsize-1998818.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[MEA condemns deadly church attack in Jordan that killed eight]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/mea-condemns-deadly-church-attack-in-jordan-that-killed-eight/articleshow/135167781.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135167781.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/mea-condemns-deadly-church-attack-in-jordan-that-killed-eight/articleshow/135167781.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/mea-condemns-deadly-church-attack-in-jordan-that-killed-eight/articleshow/135167781.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-24T15:43:14+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aadrita Halder</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135167812,imgsize-221544.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Ashoke Sen: Indian Physicist honoured with 2026 Oskar Klein Medal for string theory work]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/ashoke-sen-indian-physicist-honoured-with-2026-oskar-klein-medal-for-string-theory-work/articleshow/135167035.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135167035.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Ashoke Sen, a distinguished physicist from ICTS, is honored with the prestigious 2026 Oskar Klein Medal, celebrating his groundbreaking work in modern string theory and its far-reaching effects. In a captivating lecture in Stockholm, he explored the complexities of gravity and black holes while shedding light on string theory's promise.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/ashoke-sen-indian-physicist-honoured-with-2026-oskar-klein-medal-for-string-theory-work/articleshow/135167035.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/ashoke-sen-indian-physicist-honoured-with-2026-oskar-klein-medal-for-string-theory-work/articleshow/135167035.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-24T15:20:04+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Mahima Sharma</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135167390,imgsize-89488.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Rubbing salt into wounds': BJP targets Rahul over Nov 1 rally, recalls 1984 anti-Sikh riots]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/rubbing-salt-into-wounds-bjp-targets-rahul-over-nov-1-rally-recalls-1984-anti-sikh-riots/articleshow/135165913.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135165913.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/rubbing-salt-into-wounds-bjp-targets-rahul-over-nov-1-rally-recalls-1984-anti-sikh-riots/articleshow/135165913.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/rubbing-salt-into-wounds-bjp-targets-rahul-over-nov-1-rally-recalls-1984-anti-sikh-riots/articleshow/135165913.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-24T13:55:35+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rohitashwa Ranjan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135165982,imgsize-832071.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[When Sonia met Rajiv: Congress leader narrates her 1st meeting with husband in X debut]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/when-sonia-met-rajiv-gandhi-congress-leader-narrates-her-1st-meeting-with-husband-in-x-debut/articleshow/135165245.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135165245.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Sonia Gandhi officially joined the social media platform X to share personal memories and insights. In her first post, she introduced her upcoming memoir titled Belonging: A Journey of Love. The memoir recounts her life experiences, including her first meeting with Rajiv Gandhi in Cambridge. Scheduled for release on November 10, the book details her journey through love and loss.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/when-sonia-met-rajiv-gandhi-congress-leader-narrates-her-1st-meeting-with-husband-in-x-debut/articleshow/135165245.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/when-sonia-met-rajiv-gandhi-congress-leader-narrates-her-1st-meeting-with-husband-in-x-debut/articleshow/135165245.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-24T13:30:58+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135165604,imgsize-1161575.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Will not sign': AISA chief Neha Bora defies Delhi police peace bond notice after HC setback]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia